xkcd content

The MIT License above covers this project's own work only. It does not cover
xkcd comics or their text, which are by Randall Munroe (https://xkcd.com/) and
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 2.5 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/2.5/). See https://xkcd.com/license.html.

The plugin contains no comic images. It downloads them from xkcd's servers when
it runs, and pressing a comic opens that comic's page on xkcd.com. The test
fixtures in tests/xkcdviewerPlugin.Tests/Fixtures/ are unedited xkcd API
responses and hold comic titles, alt text and transcripts: they are xkcd
content under CC BY-NC 2.5, included for testing only.

"xkcd" is used only to say which comic the plugin shows. This is an unofficial
fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by xkcd or Randall Munroe. The
logo in art/ is this project's own drawing, not xkcd's logo.
